# Overrides the repo default (include/.dockerignore), which ignores everything
# except defaults/patches/scripts — that default is written for apps that fetch
# all their source from upstream. honcho-mcp COPYs its own authored files into
# the image, so allow exactly those. The CI rsyncs include/ with
# --ignore-existing, so this file is kept instead of being overwritten.
*

!Dockerfile
!docker-bake.hcl
!package.json
!bun.lock
!tsconfig.json
!src
